mw3Jo01ezby9htapD0nNbY0iDqc6h-sw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRnwhNIgHrLwTYKuAQKJ4jUIhNKsanYwEOZ-x9L6hS2qg&oe=6B0C4B5E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "\u6a2a\u7248\u5c01\u9762.png", "id": "1189218307009815", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624395_1189218310343148_2698386406489628834_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qkPAAwQQe24Q7kNvwF8tbR8&_nc_oc=Adq8AsxZ1hFuJXVlEHN1DlmiI9WqtFRblLzFZLjEX9OxYm18SCT5CfBh6IhXVBm7Czo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQdfL2mlIMdqathW2fr2fDZbs8yY6ZMzzXQON1JadZNsA&oe=6B0C607B"}, "display_name": "Return to 2000", "keywords": ["nostalgia", "childhood", "courtyard", "exploration"], "long_description": "Return to 2000 takes you to Rongyin New Village, a Chinese residential neighborhood at the turn of the millennium. Walk past tiled apartment blocks, follow the paths under the trees, and spend a little time with the things children found to do before dinner.\n\nThrow a paper airplane from the courtyard pavilion. Try hopscotch, flick marbles, or pick up a paddle at the table-tennis area. Walk down to the corner shop for an ice pop or soda. Inside apartment A101, slide the window, open a drawer, and look through a picture book.\n\nExplore at your own pace with teleportation, smooth movement, snap turning, and height settings. Watch the neighborhood change from a golden afternoon to rain, snow, or night.\n\nThis is a single-player VR experience played with tracked controllers. Menus, readable signs, the picture book, and the telephone message are in English.", "short_description": "Spend a summer afternoon in a Chinese neighborhood at the turn of the millennium. Fly a paper airplane, play hopscotch and marbles, and explore the corner shop and an old family apartment in a quiet, single-player VR experience.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "h